# A market data message is dropped before it reaches the app.
#
# The app detects the gap in feed sequence numbers, cancels both quotes, and
# stops quoting for the rest of the run, even though the market keeps moving.
#
# Participants: 2 and 3 provide the book, 5 adds depth.

latency market_data 5_000
latency order_entry 10_000
timer 1_000_000
end 20_000_000

# The Add for participant 5's ask at 6 ms (feed sequence 8) never arrives.
# (Sequences 1-4 are the initial book, 5-6 our quotes, 7 participant 5's bid.)
drop_market_data 8

0            2 enter 1 B 500 100.00
0            2 enter 2 B 400 99.99
0            3 enter 1 S 500 100.01
0            3 enter 2 S 400 100.02

# Depth changes: harmless.
3_000_000    5 enter 1 B 200 99.98
6_000_000    5 enter 2 S 200 100.03

# The next message after the drop reveals the gap.
8_000_000    5 enter 3 B 100 99.97

# The market moves; the app no longer reacts.
10_000_000   3 cancel 1
12_000_000   2 enter 3 B 300 100.01
